1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,800
Corta un puerro
bien fino

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,800
Ahora la cebolla

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,800
El pimiento
verde a la sartén

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,800
Y se suma la cebolla

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,800
Cocina hasta
que esté tierno

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,300
Echa la nata

7
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,300
Derrite el queso azul

8
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,300
Ñoquis al
agua hirviendo

9
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,300
Suma el puerro pochado

10
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,300
Ñoquis y
tomates cherry

11
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:32,300
Mezcla todo bien

12
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,300
Gruyère rallado
por encima

13
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,300
A cenar
